      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也想搭全像傳送梯到上面去嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŗ",
